        "content": "### Offboarding Device Audit (sanitised)\n\nTicket-triggered \u2192 fetch employee's device(s) \u2192 fetch removable-media history (90-day lookback) \u2192 summarise \u2192 comment on ticket \u2192 flag for manual review if anything was found.",
